   "text": "/* 更新侧（持 lock）*/\nold = rcu_dereference_protected(gp, lockdep_is_held(&lock));\nrcu_assign_pointer(gp, new);\nkfree_rcu(old, rcu);\n/* 读侧 */\nrcu_read_lock(); p = rcu_dereference(gp); if (p) use(p); rcu_read_unlock();",
   "originalText": "/* 更新侧（持 lock）*/\nold = rcu_dereference_protected(gp, lockdep_is_held(&lock));\nrcu_assign_pointer(gp, new);\nkfree_rcu(old, rcu);\n/* 读侧 */\nrcu_read_lock(); p = rcu_dereference(gp); if (p) use(p); rcu_read_unlock();",
