   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "先看：self-detected 还是 other；\nfqs=、gp_state、ticks_this_gp、softirq= 几个字段\n\n开关：rcupdate.rcu_cpu_stall_ftrace_dump=1\nrcupdate.rcu_cpu_stall_cputime=1\nsysctl kernel.panic_on_rcu_stall=1（拿 vmcore）\n\n常见根因：关抢占 / 关中断的长循环；中断风暴；\nGP kthread 被饿死；nohz_full CPU 没有 tick",
   "originalText": "先看：self-detected 还是 other；\nfqs=、gp_state、ticks_this_gp、softirq= 几个字段\n\n开关：rcupdate.rcu_cpu_stall_ftrace_dump=1\nrcupdate.rcu_cpu_stall_cputime=1\nsysctl kernel.panic_on_rcu_stall=1（拿 vmcore）\n\n常见根因：关抢占 / 关中断的长循环；中断风暴；\nGP kthread 被饿死；nohz_full CPU 没有 tick",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
