   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "先看：rcuc / rcuog / rcuo 线程是否抢占业务 CPU；\n是否收到 expedited 的 IPI\n\n开关：rcu_utilization 事件、\nosnoise / timerlat tracer\n\n处理：rcu_nocbs= 卸载、线程绑到管理核；\nrcupdate.rcu_normal=1 关掉 expedited 的 IPI",
   "originalText": "先看：rcuc / rcuog / rcuo 线程是否抢占业务 CPU；\n是否收到 expedited 的 IPI\n\n开关：rcu_utilization 事件、\nosnoise / timerlat tracer\n\n处理：rcu_nocbs= 卸载、线程绑到管理核；\nrcupdate.rcu_normal=1 关掉 expedited 的 IPI",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "sxVWTshm",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 3423.199999999999,
   "width": 1252.7999999999988,
   "height": 22.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0223",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1223,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8564,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RCU trace 事件：除 rcu_utilization 和 rcu_stall_warning 外，其余都需要 CONFIG_RCU_TRACE（依赖 DEBUG_KERNEL，生产内核先确认）",
   "originalText": "RCU trace 事件：除 rcu_utilization 和 rcu_stall_warning 外，其余都需要 CONFIG_RCU_TRACE（依赖 DEBUG_KERNEL，生产内核先确认）",
